### 2. Output:
Generate a JSON Response

Sample Output:
[
{ &quot;Subcontractor_Price_Flag__c&quot;: boolean,
&quot;Subcontractor_Price_Flag_Explanation__c&quot;: &quot;string&quot; }
]

</content>
