1. Valcourt Core Self-Perform Scope
Assign this group if the item matches any of the following internal scope indicators (match aggressively on singular/plural forms and variations):
- Waterproofing / Sealants / Caulking: waterproofing, sealant, caulking, joint sealant, traffic coating, deck coating, elastomeric, polyurethane sealant, silicone sealant, fluid-applied membrane, sheet membrane, below-grade waterproofing.
- Expansion Joints: expansion joint, seismic joint, movement joint, building joint, pre-manufactured joint.
- Grout Injection: grout injection, crack injection, epoxy injection, urethane injection, pressure grouting, structural crack repair.
- Coatings: coating, protective coating, epoxy coating, urethane coating, anti-carbonation coating.
- Masonry Repair: masonry repair, repointing / tuckpointing, mortar replacement, CMU repair, brick repair, stone repair.
- Concrete Repair / Structural: concrete repair, concrete patching, spall repair, structural concrete repair, delamination repair, carbon fiber wrap (CFRP), shotcrete, form &amp; pour.

2. Branch-Dependent / Conditional Scope
Assign this group if the item matches any conditional trades requiring estimator verification:
- Windows: window replacement, glazing replacement, storefront, curtain wall, window retrofit.
- Roofing: roof repair, roof replacement, membrane roofing, flashing repair, roof coating.
- Post-Tension (limited branches): post tension, PT cable, tendon repair, cable stressing, stressing operations.

3. High-Risk / Out of Scope (Big Ticket Triggers)
Assign this group if the item represents a specialty/high-risk trade typically requiring subcontractors, or if it does not fit into any of the self-perform or conditional categories above. Flag and surface any items matching these specific subcontractor-likely keywords prominently:
- Steel / Welding: welding, structural steel repair, steel reinforcement, field welding, metal fabrication.
- Access / Means &amp; Methods: scaffolding, swing stage, bosun’s chair, man lift, building access system, temporary access.
- Roofing (large scope): full roof replacement, tear-off, re-roof, roof system replacement.
- Window Systems (large scope): curtain wall replacement, façade glazing system, bulk window replacement.
- Post‑Tension (major repairs): PT cable replacement, tendon replacement, full stressing program.
- Engineering / Design: structural engineer, engineering services, stamped drawings, PE review, load calculations, shoring design.
- Temporary Support: shoring, reshoring, temporary support, needle beam.
- Interior Finishes: drywall replacement, ceiling replacement, flooring replacement, paint restoration, interior finish repair.
- Site / Specialty: line striping, pavement markings, traffic control.

