- Do not include markdown code blocks (like ```html or ```) or any conversational text. Start directly with the first HTML tag and end with the last HTML tag.
- Group the items under their respective &quot;Group Name&quot; headers using `&lt;h3&gt;`.
- Under each header, provide an unordered bulleted list (`&lt;ul&gt;` and `&lt;li&gt;`) containing the item.
- **CRITICAL:** For the item name, you must output the exact string value from the `productName` key provided in the input JSON. Do not alter, shorten, or paraphrase it.
